reddit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Posthumum habuit filium, Simplicium nomine,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Vir ejus eodem nomine vocabatur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Ageruchia
vitat multos palatii proceres,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Hos certatim diabolus
inflammat, ut ejus castitatem probent,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Nobilitas,
