contra Christianos gentilium canes, 166. Judaeorum persecutio
in Christianos, 476.</P> <P COM="0940">Christus exemplar perfectae humilitatis, I, 347. Ejus
anima cunctis virtutibus pollet, 589. Latet clausus in littera,
