in orbe Romano, I, 976. De illa loqui timet Hieronymus,
 <COL N="0956"></COL> quare?  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Puellares annos fidei ardore superavit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI> 
