futura pronuntiet,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI>  Futura semper cavenda in
prosperis, IV, 547. Futurorum solus Deus habet notitiam,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid. et</HI>  1033, 1046.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0982" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0982">G</HEAD> <P COM="0982">Gaas interpretatur  <HI REND="ITALIC">commotio,</HI>  II, 272.</P> <P COM="0982">Gabaa, et Rama, duae civitates tribus Benjamin, VI, 54.</P> <P COM="0982">Gabriel Hebraei dictum volunt angelum Assyrii exercitus
