IV, 371. Gethsemani, quid significet, VII, 218.</P> <P COM="0984">Gigantum impietas totius orbis naufragium adduxit, I,
23. Gigantes dicti Enacim, derelicti in Azoto, III, 146. In
Gaza fortissimi Allophilorum, 218. Gigas in bonam et malam
