appetitum ciborum, II, 342.</P> <P COM="0997">Hordei farina cur potationi  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>touð ejligmouð</FOREIGN>  adjuncta, VI, 342.</P> <P COM="0997">Hormiscus, torques, vel monile, III, 515.</P> <P COM="0997">Horologii Achaz gradus quomodo arte mechanica constructi,
