II, 546.</P> <P COM="0997">Hostem, dum parvus est, interfice, I, 92. Hostes an fraude
decipiendi, V, 194.</P> <P COM="0997">Hostiam mutilam qui obtulerit, sacrilegii reus est, I,
684. Teipsum vult Dominus hostiam vivam, placentem Deo,
