libris utebatur, ex quibus nonnulla sunt, etc.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="1018">Laabim, Phutaei dicti sunt, III, 320.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="1018" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="1018">M</HEAD> <P COM="1018">Macarius monachus Aegyptius columna Christi, I, 705.</P> <P COM="1018">Macarius, Antonii discipulus, et alius Macarius, II, 582, 640.</P> <P COM="1018">Machabaeorum insignis victoria, I, 619. In Ecclesiis Christi
