 <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="1019">Mahon explicatur, I, 1052.</P> <P COM="1019">Majoma emporium Gazae, II, 15.</P> <P COM="1019">Major et minor non inter tres, sed inter duos solent
praebere distantiam, II, 219.</P> <P COM="1019">Majorum sequenda vestigia, et ab auctoritate eorum discrepare
