IV, 32, Manichaei dogma impium, VI, 582, 619. Manichaeus,
VII, 54, 211, 473, 737. Error ejusdem, 85, 107, 548. Dogma
Manichaei refutatur, 48. Provocatur, 98, 105.</P> <P COM="1020">Manichaei dicuntur impurissimi, I, 519. Cur plurima ex
