V, 704. Secunda navis post naufragium erubescere,
696.</P> <P COM="1031">Navigantes quibus casibus opprimuntur, IV, 533.</P> <P COM="1031">Naum exponitur  <HI REND="ITALIC">consolator,</HI>  VI, 533. Cur juxta LXX
post Jonam positus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></P> <P COM="1031">Nazarei, sive Nazareni sectarii, utebantur Evangelio
