VI, 98  <HI REND="ITALIC">et seq.</HI></P> <P COM="1031"><COL N="1032"></COL> Neser, quid? IV, 255.</P> <P COM="1032">Nesrah, Deus Ninivitarum, IV, 466.</P> <P COM="1032">Nestoris facundia, I, 357.</P> <P COM="1032">Nevii poetae sententia, I, 342.</P> <P COM="1032">Neusis lacus, III, 203.</P> <P COM="1032">Nicaena synodus quos damnavit? I, 528. In illa silentium
fuit de Spiritu sancto, quare? 235. Ejus decretum prohibens
