contendunt, III, 344.</P> <P COM="1078">Syrtis a tractu nomen habet impositum juxta Sallustium,
III, 104.</P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="1078" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="1078">T</HEAD> <P COM="1078">Tabeel vel homo, vel idolum, IV, 203.</P> <P COM="1078">Tabellarii unde sic dicti, I, 21.</P> <P COM="1078">Tabennensium monachorum exempla, I, 57.</P> <P COM="1078">Tabernaculi sacri mysterium explicatur, I, 360. In ejus
